#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:5
msgid "エンタルピー"
msgstr "Enthalpy"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:9
msgid "定義"
msgstr "Definition"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:11
msgid ""
"H = U + pV\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"H = U + pV\n"
"\n"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:17
msgid "標準エンタルピー変化"
msgstr "Standard Enthalpy Change"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:19
msgid "始めと終わりの物質が、それぞれの\\ :ref:`標準状態<standard_state>`\\ にあるような過程におけるエンタルピーの変化。"
msgstr ""
"The change in enthalpy for a process in which the initial and final "
"substances are in their respective \\ :ref:`standard states "
"<standard_state>`\\ ."

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:24
msgid "標準反応エンタルピー"
msgstr "Standard Reaction Enthalpy"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:26
msgid ""
"反応物と生成物がすべて標準状態にあるとき、反応が反応式どおりに1 mol進む間のエンタルピー変化。 反応式を "
":math:`\\sum_i\\nu_i\\mathrm A_i=0`\\ （:math:`\\nu_i` "
"は生成物で正、反応物で負の化学量論係数）と書き、 成分 :math:`i` の標準状態での1 molあたりのエンタルピーを "
":math:`H_{{\\rm m},i}^o` とすると、"
msgstr ""
"The enthalpy change when the reaction proceeds by 1 mol as written, with "
"all reactants and products in their standard states. Writing the reaction"
" as :math:`\\sum_i\\nu_i\\mathrm A_i=0`\\  (where :math:`\\nu_i` is the "
"stoichiometric coefficient, positive for products and negative for "
"reactants) and denoting the molar enthalpy of component :math:`i` in its "
"standard state by :math:`H_{{\\rm m},i}^o`, we have"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:30
msgid "\\Delta_r H^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i H_{{\\rm m},i}^o"
msgstr "\\Delta_r H^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i H_{{\\rm m},i}^o"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:35
msgid ""
"である。単位は kJ/mol で、「mol」は反応式1回分を指す。エンタルピーの絶対値は決まらないので、 "
"実際には次の標準生成エンタルピーから求める。"
msgstr ""
"The unit is kJ/mol, where “per mol” means per mole of reaction as "
"written. Because absolute values of enthalpy cannot be determined, the "
"standard reaction enthalpy is obtained in practice from the standard "
"enthalpy of formation of each component, described next."

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:41
msgid "標準生成エンタルピー"
msgstr "Standard Enthalpy of Formation"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:43
msgid ""
"化合物1 molが、\\ :ref:`基準状態<reference_state>`\\ にある構成元素から生成するときの標準反応エンタルピー "
":math:`\\Delta_f H^o`。生成反応は化合物の化学量論係数を1として書く。例えば液体の水では :math:`\\mathrm "
"H_2(\\mathrm g)+\\tfrac12\\mathrm O_2(\\mathrm g)\\to\\mathrm H_2\\mathrm"
" O(\\mathrm l)` の 標準反応エンタルピーで、298.15 Kで :math:`-285.83` "
"kJ/molである。定義から、基準状態の元素の :math:`\\Delta_f H^o` は0である。"
msgstr ""
"The standard reaction enthalpy :math:`\\Delta_f H^o` for forming 1 mol of"
" a compound from its constituent elements in their \\ :ref:`reference "
"states <reference_state>`\\ . The formation reaction is written with a "
"stoichiometric coefficient of 1 for the compound. For liquid water, for "
"example, it is the standard reaction enthalpy of :math:`\\mathrm "
"H_2(\\mathrm g)+\\tfrac12\\mathrm O_2(\\mathrm g)\\to\\mathrm H_2\\mathrm"
" O(\\mathrm l)`, which is :math:`-285.83` kJ/mol at 298.15 K. By "
"definition, :math:`\\Delta_f H^o` is zero for an element in its reference"
" state."

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:48
msgid ""
"エンタルピーは状態量なので、反応の始めと終わりの間を、基準状態の元素を経由する経路で置き換えてもエンタルピー変化は変わらない（Hessの法則）。 "
"このため任意の反応の標準反応エンタルピーは"
msgstr ""
"Because enthalpy is a state function, replacing the path between the "
"initial and final states of a reaction with one that passes through the "
"elements in their reference states does not change the enthalpy change "
"(Hess's law). The standard reaction enthalpy of any reaction is therefore"
" given by"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:51
msgid "\\Delta_r H^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i\\Delta_f H_i^o"
msgstr "\\Delta_r H^o=\\sum_i\\nu_i\\Delta_f H_i^o"

#: ../../thermo/enthalpy.rst:56
msgid "と、各成分の標準生成エンタルピーから求まる。"
msgstr "in terms of the standard enthalpy of formation of each component."

